sequenceDiagram
    actor S as Student
    participant W as Web app
    participant MS as Match service
    participant D as Database

    S->>W: Open My Activities
    W->>MS: getActivityHistory(userId)
    MS->>D: Read matches of the user with status completed
    D-->>MS: matches (cancelled and upcoming are excluded)
    MS-->>W: Records newest first (sport, date, time, facility)
    W-->>S: Show list or empty message
